OL,6,     FDutch violinist Andre Rieu brings
OL,7,     Fhis orchestra to an atmospheric
OL,8,     FBerlin amphitheatre, with musical
OL,9,     Ffavourites like Ravel's Bolero,
OL,10,     FLara's Theme from Doctor Zhivago
OL,11,     Fand Auld Lang Syne.
